"Rabbit Recall: a Meister entrusts a weapon, the bearer preserves it, and the Meister's recall pulls both."
"Preserving the weapon rightly preserves its bond to the Meister, so the bearer bridges the call."
"The bearer's skill tires fast; when it gives out, the weapon alone flies to the Meister."
"It has been shown only with Let Me Take Your Luggage, first in a Celena North Coursing run in 2041."
